==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|sækja heim|sækja einhvern heim|to visit somebody}}, from {{der|is|non|sœkja heim||to visit; to attack someone}}. Compare {{cog|da|hjemsøge}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|heimsótti|heimsótt}}

# {{lb|is|transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[visit]], to [[pay a visit]]

